{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/b863afa1932302d169d7975d84a95f18.poster.avif?t=1772729435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/b863afa1932302d169d7975d84a95f18.webm?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/b863afa1932302d169d7975d84a95f18.mp4?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>READY TO SAVE SOME GODS?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valkyrie Rising: Hordes of Ragnar\u00f6k is a Norse horde-survivor roguelite where you battle through the relentless Hordes of Ragnar\u00f6k. Explore handcrafted maps, enhance your abilities, and upgrade your weapons to survive as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/06278e4e72b588d679fbd600eee4c90c.poster.avif?t=1772729435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/06278e4e72b588d679fbd600eee4c90c.webm?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/06278e4e72b588d679fbd600eee4c90c.mp4?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through enemies and gather XP to level up. Each upgrade is randomly generated with varying power, making every run unique and unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/a5e06305018c28e4835f9316361ce467.poster.avif?t=1772729435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/a5e06305018c28e4835f9316361ce467.webm?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/a5e06305018c28e4835f9316361ce467.mp4?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete diverse quests to earn the blessings of Odin, Thor, and other gods. Unleash lightning strikes, summon celestial weapons, or shatter the earth beneath your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/69163362eb3f95d216bcb6fe645ccf60.poster.avif?t=1772729435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/69163362eb3f95d216bcb6fe645ccf60.webm?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/69163362eb3f95d216bcb6fe645ccf60.mp4?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless hordes of enemies, including powerful bosses and elite enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP and level up to grow stronger every minute</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on quests that let you channel the powers of the gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shattered realms of Asgard across multiple handcrafted maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build customizable abilities that demand precision and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the abilities of your weapon to unlock new playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent upgrades after each run to grow ever stronger</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214330?t=1772729435","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/6a63bc11f86fa1d51364f930b27b24d5c4607f3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772729435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/4c2cd0dce7dcaaa797fba8e8b39d8e4e80657a01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772729435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/4c2cd0dce7dcaaa797fba8e8b39d8e4e80657a01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772729435","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/b863afa1932302d169d7975d84a95f18.poster.avif?t=1772729435\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/b863afa1932302d169d7975d84a95f18.webm?t=1772729435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste